variants.A:
`POST /api/articles/:slug/comments`

Example request body:

```json
{
  "comment": {
    "body": "His name was my name too."
  }
}
```

Authentication required, returns the created [Comment](/specifications/backend/api-response-format#single-comment)

Required field: `body`

